				<img height="283" src="img/sawaganiPlus021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/mono/sawagani_plus/img/sawaganiPlus021.jpg" --></a><a href="img/sawaganiPlus022.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/sawaganiPlus022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/mono/sawagani_plus/img/sawaganiPlus022.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
